{
  "id": "2CH.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Ebyomumirembe 10",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Bayibuli Entukuvu, Endagaano Enkadde nʼEndagaano Empya ekwatiddwa ku katambi™ Obwannannyini© 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 bwa Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" Linnya ery'obwannannyini eryawandiisibwa Biblica mu Amerika era nga balina n'ekkakkalabozo, Inc. Bwaweebwa olukusa okulikozesa. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isirayiri Ejeemera Lekobowaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lekobowaamu n'agenda e Sekemu, Abayisirayiri bonna gye baali bagenze okumufuula kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowaamu mutabani wa Nebati bwe yakiwulira, kubanga yali mu Misiri gye yali addukidde mu buwaŋŋanguse, nga yeewala kabaka Sulemaani, n'akomawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ne bamutumira, Yerobowaamu ne Isirayiri yenna ne bagenda eri Lekobowaamu ne bamugamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kitaawo yatuteekako ekikoligo ekinene, naye kaakano tukendeereze ku lyanyi n'ekikoligo kye yatuteekako, naffe tunaakuweereza.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abaddamu nti, \"Mulikomawo gye ndi mu nnaku ssatu.\" Abantu ne bagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo kabaka Lekobowaamu ne yeebuuza ku bakadde abaaweerezanga kitaawe Sulemaani ng'akyali mulamu. N'ababuuza nti, \"Mumpa kya kuddamu ki eri abantu bano?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bamugamba nti, \"Bw'onooba ow'ekisa eri abantu bano, n'obasanyusa, n'obaddamu bulungi, banaabeeranga baddu bo ennaku zonna.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Lekobowaamu n'aggaya amagezi abakadde ge baali bamuwadde, n'agenda ne yeebuuza ku bavubuka be yali akuze nabo, ate nga be bamuweereza mu kiseera ekyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ababuuza nti, \"Mumpa magezi ki okuddamu abantu bano abaŋŋambye nti, 'Tukendeereze ku kikoligo kitaawo kye yatuteekako?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abavubuka be yali akuze nabo ne bamuddamu nti, \"Gamba abantu abakugambye nti, 'Ekikoligo kitaawo kye yatuteekako kyali kizito, naye kaakano kitukendeerezeko,' nti, 'Nasswi wange asinga ekiwato kya kitange obunene. Kitange yababinika ekikoligo ekizito, naye nze nzija kwongera ku kikoligo kyammwe obuzito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitange yabakangavvulanga na nkoba naye nze nzija kubakangavvulanga na njaba ez'obusagwa.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe waayitawo ennaku essatu Yerobowaamu n'abantu bonna ne bagenda eri Lekobowaamu, nga kabaka bwe yali ayogedde nti, \"Mukomeewo oluvannyuma lw'ennaku ssatu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka n'addamu n'ebboggo. N'agaana okuwuliriza amagezi g'abakadde,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'agoberera amagezi ag'abavubuka, n'ayogera nti, \"Kitange yababinika ekikoligo ekizito, naye nze nzija kukyongerako obuzito. Kitange yabakangavvulanga na nkoba, naye nze nzija kubakangavvulanga na njaba ez'obusagwa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka n'atawuliriza bantu kubanga bw'atyo Katonda bwe yasiima, okutuukiriza ekigambo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.10.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kye yayogera ku Yerobowaamu mutabani wa Nebati ng'ayita mu Akiya Omusiiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Isirayiri yenna bwe baalaba nga kabaka agaanye okubawuliriza, ne bamuddamu nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CH 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Mugabo ki gwe tulina mu Dawudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CH 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "era busika ki bwe tulina mu mutabani wa Yese?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CH 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buli omu ku mmwe, addeyo mu weema ye, ayi Isirayiri!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CH 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mmwe ennyumba ye Dawudi mwerabirire.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "2CH 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Awo Abayisirayiri bonna ne baddayo ewaabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abo abaabeeranga mu bibuga bya Yuda, Lekobowaamu n'asigala ng'abafuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka Lekobowaamu n'atuma Kadolaamu eyavunaanyizibwanga emirimu egy'ekipakasi, naye Abayisirayiri ne bamukuba amayinja ne bamutta. Kabaka Lekobowaamu ye n'ayanguwa okulinnya eggaali lye n'addukira e Yerusaalemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Isirayiri ne bajeemera ennyumba ya Dawudi n'okutuusa leero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "2CH.11",
    "number": "11",
    "bookId": "2CH"
  },
